// SacrificeEvent: Feed to the Squirrel for a special event
// SacrificeEventPlural: Feed {0} to the Squirrel for a special event
// EnchantedTreeDupable: Can be duplicated with Enchanted Tree
// ScopeViewToggle: Binocular vision disabled
